1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,733
12:20 AM. The train slows. The brakes
sigh. Outside, a platform glows
through the fog.

2
00:00:06,233 --> 00:00:09,067
A white sign on the platform. Nothing
written on it.

3
00:00:09,567 --> 00:00:17,767
Rule five. Don't look out of the
window at a station with no name. Look
at the floor. Look at your hands. Look
at anything else.

4
00:00:18,267 --> 00:00:22,567
The doors open. Cold air rolls in. It
smells like rain on a summer street.
